Honor Retry-After on HTTP 403, 429 and 503 for provider downloads.

A valid Retry-After header supplies a server deadline for scheduled and
manual updates. Keep the local backoff as the minimum scheduled delay.
Responses without a usable deadline follow the ordinary backoff.

